            <li><a href="#one-percent-incline">Should You Set 1% Incline?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#is-10-minute-mile-good">Is a 10-Minute Mile Good?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#what-speed-to-run">What Speed Should You Run on a Treadmill?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#build-up">How to Build Up to a 10-Minute Mile</a></li>
            <li><a href="#is-the-speed-right">Is Your Treadmill's 6 mph Really 6 mph?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
